---
name: Onboard Palo Alto Networks syslog via UDP
description: |
  Reads Palo Alto Networks syslog over UDP, normalizes PAN-OS CSV payloads to
  OCSF 1.9, and publishes them to the topic `ocsf`.
---

accept_udp "udp://0.0.0.0:514"
this = data.parse_syslog()
paloalto::ocsf::normalize
ocsf::derive
publish "ocsf"
